   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi!<div><br></div><div>I have two questions, first: is it possible somehow to set some initial values instead of all of them with stan/sampling command? I couldn&#39;t find it in the manual, but maybe there&#39;s some trick to do it?</div><div>And the second is, how can I get the initial values when I use optimizing:</div><div>I tried:</div><div><br></div><div><div>o &lt;- optimizing(model,data=list)</div></div><div>i&lt;-get_inits(o)<br></div><div><br></div><div>But this doesn&#39;t work.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!!</div><div><br></div><div>Bruno</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
